  "title": "HB 26 (2024 Regular Session (LIS session code 20241)): Voter identification; accepted forms of identification, private entities licensed or certified.",
  "urls": [
    "https://legacylis.virginia.gov/cgi-bin/legp604.exe?241+sum+HB26",
